; Export list of Processing.NDI.Lib.Advanced.x64.dll (NDI 6 Advanced SDK),
; extracted from the installed SDK's DLL export table. Used only to build
; a stub import library so CI can LINK the plugin without the access-gated
; SDK; the stub DLL contains no NDI code and is never shipped or loaded.
; Regenerate: python scripts/dump_ndi_exports.py <path-to-dll>
; The .dll extension is load-bearing: the import library records this exact
; string as the DLL to import from, and /DELAYLOAD only matches on string
; equality - without the extension the linker ignores the flag (LNK4199) and
; the NDI import silently reverts to load-time in stub builds.
LIBRARY "Processing.NDI.Lib.Advanced.x64.dll"
